  "releaseNotes": "'## [13.2.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v13.1.3...v13.2.0) (2026-09-01)\n\n### Features\n\n* **cli/rbac:** introduce namespaced RBAC generation support ([#1230](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1230)) ([2fedf17](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/2fedf1705d9fa381dd17e88cd3c81bf79e718121)), closes [#1213](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1213)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **core:** update aspire monorepo ([#1231](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1231)) ([71e991b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/71e991be770f4262bec9b5e8657f4269cd7745d0))\n* **core:** update dependency ziggycreatures.fusioncache to 2.7.2 ([#1232](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1232)) ([7d96d5e](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/7d96d5effb695eb9c78a3cf1b87eaa9c2ecc78b6))\n* **test:** update xunit-dotnet monorepo (major) ([#1219](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1219)) ([604e77f](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/604e77fd8a2a807e9a6d0b011b27dfd4e7e275f9))\n'",
